I was 13 back then. We were the same age and alone in the world. We became friends quickly.

214
00:12:09,060 --> 00:12:21,620
Sadly, Sabito had a strong sense of justice, and yet a kind and gentle heart.

215
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:28,400
