266
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:41,620
Muzan, though he doesn't acknowledge it.

267
00:16:42,340 --> 00:16:47,060
I can't imagine how hard he must have trained in order to make himself a worthy candidate for Hashira.

268
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:49,940
The amount of suffering he must have gone through.

269
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:54,820
It's not my place to criticize Mr. Giyu when I know nothing about him.

270
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:57,940
But, but there's one thing I have to ask him.

271
00:16:58,500 --> 00:16:59,140
Only then.

272
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:01,300
Mr. Giyu!

273
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:03,540
Oh no, he's not stopping.

274
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:06,020
Mr. Giyu!

275
00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:07,540
Mr. Giyu!

276
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:08,260
Mr. Giyu!

277
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:09,940
What Sabito entrusted to you?

278
00:17:10,660 --> 00:17:23,060
Aren't you going to pass it on?

279
00:17:23,060 --> 00:17:25,140
Mr. Giyu!

280
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:25,220
Mr. Giyu!

281
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:29,780
Don't you dare ever say that you should have died again!

282
00:17:30,500 --> 00:17:30,580
Mr. Giyu!

283
00:17:30,580 --> 00:17:33,220
Next time you say that, you and I are through.

284
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:34,260
It's unforgivable.

285
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:42,100
Your older sister, who was supposed to be married the next day, knew what was going to happen when she hid you from that demon to protect you.

286
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:46,420
So how dare you insult her memory by saying something so selfish?

287
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:49,300
You have to live and carry her memory!

288
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:56,900
The life your sister gave you with her sacrifice, the future she gave you, you have to pass them on!

289
00:17:57,860 --> 00:17:58,340
Giyu!

290
00:18:00,020 --> 00:18:00,580
It hurts.

291
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:06,900
The shock and pain I felt when he struck me is coming back to me now so vividly.

292
00:18:06,900 --> 00:18:20,900
Why did I forget until now that conversation with Sabito when it's so important?

293
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:28,260
I didn't want to remember it because I wouldn't be able to stop the tears.

294
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:41,620
Remembering made my grief unbearable and left me utterly helpless.

295
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:47,860
Big sis, Tsutaku. Sabito. I'm sorry.

296
00:18:47,860 --> 00:18:53,700
Oh no. I think I finally broke him.

297
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:56,980
What do I do? Was that too harsh of me?

298
00:18:57,780 --> 00:19:00,420
Somehow he looks even more depressed than he usually does.

299
00:19:01,060 --> 00:19:02,740
Did I just end up making it worse?

300
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:06,820
I know. How about a speed eating contest?

301
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:10,980
If I win the contest, I'll say, let's cheer up and get some training in.

302
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:12,180
Or something.

303
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:17,380
Since I haven't been cleared for active duty yet, it's not like I can spar with him or anything.

304
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:22,900
Mr. Giyu may not talk much, but he wouldn't have to during an eating contest. It's brilliant!

305
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:27,220
Tanjiro, I know it's a little late, but I'll join the-

306
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:30,020
Mr. Giyu! I challenge you to an eating contest!

307
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:32,340
Mr. Giyu! Why?

308
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:43,700
Listen, about the training program. I didn't hear any mention of Kocho.

309
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:46,580
So what is it that she's teaching you all?

310
00:19:48,820 --> 00:19:54,580
Ms. Shinobu? I haven't heard anything, actually. I wonder how she is.

311
00:19:56,500 --> 00:19:58,340
Calm down. It's all right.

312
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:03,620
Big Sis, help me to calm down.

313
00:20:04,900 --> 00:20:08,020
Only the immature are unable to control their emotions.

314
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:10,020
The immature…

315
00:20:17,220 --> 00:20:19,140
Master, you have returned.

316
00:20:19,140 --> 00:20:24,260
Master, I'll be departing now to receive training from the Lord Wind Hashira.

317
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:25,700
I see.

318
00:20:26,500 --> 00:20:30,340
Can our training session wait until after the Lord Stone Hashiras?

319
00:20:32,260 --> 00:20:36,260
Unfortunately, I'm not going to be taking part in the Hashira training.

320
00:20:36,260 --> 00:20:39,300
Huh? But… But why?

321
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:43,780
Kanau? Come over here.

322
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:46,500
Okay.

323
00:20:50,660 --> 00:20:52,660
So, um… You see…

324
00:20:52,660 --> 00:20:57,700
I want… I want nothing more than to train with you, Master.

325
00:21:02,020 --> 00:21:06,820
Well, now look at you. You've learned to be more candid about giving voice to your feelings.

326
00:21:07,780 --> 00:21:08,820
That's a good sign.

327
00:21:10,500 --> 00:21:11,220
As I thought…

328
00:21:11,860 --> 00:21:13,140
The timing is perfect.

329
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:17,060
I'd like to tell you…

330
00:21:18,100 --> 00:21:21,220
About the demon who killed my beloved older sister, Kanai.

331
00:21:21,220 --> 00:21:27,140
And also, how to go about killing the same demon.

332
00:21:28,020 --> 00:21:29,060
I believe you're ready.

333
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:32,220
How did you just tell me that I was jet Marc?

334
00:21:34,700 --> 00:21:35,620
My fate is not?

335
00:21:35,940 --> 00:21:37,300
My mother…

336
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:40,820
Why John Explore …

337
00:21:40,820 --> 00:21:42,900
And I love you.

338
00:21:43,860 --> 00:21:45,300
Okay.

339
00:21:47,620 --> 00:21:48,740
You've seen us.

340
00:21:49,420 --> 00:21:51,660
isenilation Father, you've seen us.

341
00:21:52,540 --> 00:21:54,300
Me and I am not happy.

342
00:21:54,820 --> 00:21:57,700
Anakin Father, you have seen us before us.

343
00:21:57,700 --> 00:22:27,680
Altyazı M.K.

344
00:22:27,700 --> 00:22:57,680
Thank you.

345
00:22:57,700 --> 00:23:27,680
Thank you.

346
00:23:27,700 --> 00:23:29,700
You really mean that?

347
00:23:30,080 --> 00:23:31,500
Yes, but no racing.

348
00:23:32,140 --> 00:23:33,320
I'd be happy to.

349
00:23:33,940 --> 00:23:38,880
But first, next episode three, fully recovered Tanjiro joins the Hashira training.

